Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [M156] [ganesh] Fix image filtering mipmap bug

Original change's description:
> [ganesh] Fix image filtering mipmap bug
>
> Prior to this CL, image filtering could fall into mipmap mode and, inadvertently, incorporate some "garbage" from scratch textures.
>
> Graphite never autogenerates Mipmaps so doesn't have this issue.
>
> The fix now shares the old downgrade_to_filter() logic between the shader and texture SpecialImage drawing paths.
>
